(described as robbers waiting in their dens to slaughter the poor) Tj T*
(innocents who venture within reach. That is all nonsense. _They win) Tj T*
(because they know how to play the game, and others who have sense) Tj T*
(enough and patience enough to play the game in the same way will win) Tj T*
(too._ They absolutely cannot help winning.) Tj T*
