(be notified when the market is up again.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_CONCLUSION._) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The contents of this book, including the Wall Street definitions given) Tj T*
(above, should give the reader a pretty clear idea of what is done on) Tj T*
(the New York Stock Exchange, and just why and how the blundering public) Tj T*
(is continually losing its money and giving Wall Street a black name.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_It should convince you that you cannot afford to attack Wall Street) Tj T*
(by the methods that have been tried so many thousands of times and) Tj T*
(found to be utter failures._) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(About the worst possible thing that can happen to a man is to take a) Tj T*
("flyer" in Wall Street and win. His winning convinces him beyond a) Tj T*
(doubt that he knows all about it, and he goes deeper and deeper,) Tj T*
(sometimes winning a little, but oftener losing, until some) Tj T*
(extraordinary turn of the market, some unforeseen incident, or some) Tj T*
(reckless piece of speculation wipes him out. That is the record of the) Tj T*
(guesses of ninety-nine out of a hundred men who try to take money out) Tj T*
(of Wall Street.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(What is the use of following right along in their footsteps and) Tj T*
(trusting to dumb luck or something of that sort to pull you out?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If you have any money that you want to make money with, go into Wall) Tj T*
(Street through our medium, and place your money in hands where it will) Tj T*
(not only be perfectly safe, but where it will be handled in the only) Tj T*
(way that can possibly beat Wall Street.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There is no doubt at all about this.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_The thing can be done, has been done, is being done, and will always) Tj T*
(be done._) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(And the men who are doing it are piling up enormous fortunes for) Tj T*
(themselves, they are the only men who get the money in the end.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If you want to be on their side instead of on the losing side, the only) Tj T*
(possible way you can do so is in the manner outlined in this book and) Tj T*
(we offer you the best, most favorable and safest opportunity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS._) Tj T*
