(Q. How many small "lots" can you handle with a capital of one hundred) Tj T*
(thousand dollars?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. About one hundred.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. In case of a sudden "slump," say twenty per cent., what is the) Tj T*
(result?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. No change of base is made.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Suppose some lots are on hand bought at higher prices?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. They are kept until sold at a profit, meantime paying a dividend.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Why do you buy dividend paying stocks?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Because they carry themselves.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. How often do you make purchases in a declining market?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. That depends on the market, the stock, the times, and conditions) Tj T*
(generally, which can be properly judged by the managers, who are) Tj T*
(devoting all their time and facilities to the business, and know the) Tj T*
(exact condition of every property dealt in.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. What would be the effect of an unexpected calamity?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Panics are a great help to this method.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. How often do you make purchases or sales?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. About every day, as some one or more of the different stocks have) Tj T*
(moved sufficiently to do some purchasing or selling.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you expect to carry a stock a year before you can sell it?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes, if necessary, but not likely, because first purchase only) Tj T*
(begins when the stock can be had at a bargain and is only a small) Tj T*
("lot," and when the average has been reached and sufficient profit) Tj T*
(made, all the little lots may be sold as one lot. It is not) Tj T*
(contemplated that this will be done unless it was desirable to close) Tj T*
(out in any particular stock. There may be some loss on first purchase,) Tj T*
(but the lowest purchases have handsome profits, and the transaction as) Tj T*
(a whole renders large returns, when it is closed out and the process) Tj T*
(commenced over again, and again.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you guarantee investments made in the bonds of your) Tj T*
(company?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes, because we know the security is absolutely safe, and we have on) Tj T*
(hand all the time during the three years either the cash or an) Tj T*
(equivalent amount in sound dividend shares in the most prosperous) Tj T*
