(railway and industrial corporations in the world.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you guarantee interest on the bonds at the rate of five per) Tj T*
(cent.?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes, we guarantee the principal and that the profits to the investor) Tj T*
(shall not be less than five per cent. per annum, payable semi-annually,) Tj T*
(and we will pay it regularly, but it will be charged against the gross) Tj T*
(profits, the same as commissions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. How much more than five per cent. do you expect the bonds will earn?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. At least 25 to 50 per cent. per annum.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. What are the denominations of the bonds?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Twenty-five dollars and upwards. We issue them in regular numbers to) Tj T*
(the purchasers for the amount of his or her investment, the same as a) Tj T*
(life insurance policy is issued.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Will these bonds have a market value during the three years?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes, and will sell above par after the first six months.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Why do you issue bonds for only twenty-five dollars?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. So as to give small investors the opportunity to join with) Tj T*
(capitalists for savings and better returns than they can get elsewhere.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Do you consider your bonds as safe and profitable as savings banks?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes, and more so, because the security is better than any savings) Tj T*
(bank which receives money, pays a low rate of interest, and loans it) Tj T*
(out on securities that do not always have a cash value. Our bonds are) Tj T*
(secured by an equivalent in cash or the safest and soundest dividend) Tj T*
(paying securities in the world, and can be sold instantly every) Tj T*
(business day in the year; furthermore, they earn not less than 5 per) Tj T*
(cent. per annum, with a practical certainty of a great deal more.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. How do you buy the securities?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Through our brokers on the floor of the exchanges.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Q. Can a bondholder in your company have information of the condition) Tj T*
(of these investments any time?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A. Yes, every day, if he wishes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
